---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between">
      <div class="max-w-sm space-y-2">
        <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Citizenship Hub</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
          Global passport rankings and citizenship-by-descent guides researched, structured, and refreshed from open
          data.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
          A project by{' '}
          <a
            href="https://builtbrilliant.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="font-medium text-slate-700 underline-offset-2 hover:text-slate-900 hover:underline"
          >
            Built Brilliant ↗
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Footer" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-sm sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <p class="font-medium text-slate-900">Explore</p>
          <a href="/" class="block text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900">Home</a>
          <a href="/passports/" class="block text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900">Passport rankings</a>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <p class="font-medium text-slate-900">Resources</p>
          <a href="/#guides" class="block text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900">Citizenship guides</a>
          <a
            href="https://www.passportindex.org"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="block text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900"
          >
            Passport Index ↗
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <p class="font-medium text-slate-900">Legal</p>
          <a href="/terms/" class="block text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>
          <a href="/privacy/" class="block text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900">Privacy Policy</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 pt-6 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
      <p>
        Data derived from{' '}
        <a
          class="underline hover:text-slate-600"
          href="https://github.com/imorte/passport-index-data"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          passport-index-data
        </a>
        {' '}(MIT license), sourced from passportindex.org. Updated 17 February 2026.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2">
        Data drawn from multiple public sources; full attribution and license details are shown on each country page.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2">
        Informational use only not legal, immigration, tax, or travel advice. Requirements change frequently; always
        verify with official government sources before travelling or applying.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2">
        © {year} Citizenship Hub — owned and operated by{' '}
        <a
          class="underline hover:text-slate-600"
          href="https://builtbrilliant.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          Built Brilliant
        </a>
        . All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
